
1. Check the headphones are on and charged (look at the LED).  
2. Restart both the headphones and my phone.  
3. On the phone: Settings → Bluetooth → turn it on.  
4. If the headphones are listed, tap them and choose **Forget This Device**.  
5. Put the headphones in pairing mode (hold the power button until the light flashes fast).  
6. On the phone, tap the headphones when they appear and connect.

If that fails, I toggle Airplane mode on/off, make sure nothing else is connected to them, or factory-reset the headphones and try again.
